{"id":"03ecee8b72b25180","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier.md","title":"统一子与最一般统一子","display":"df-unifier-most-general-unifier — 统一子与最一般统一子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier","aliases":["72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier"],"display":"df-unifier-most-general-unifier — 统一子与最一般统一子","depends_on":["[[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §2.5, print648/PDF660","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source definitions and composition direction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_deep":"不同元数谓词比较时避免越界项投影"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-unifier-most-general-unifier — 统一子与最一般统一子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed15cbe9da0035aa\" href=\"?note=ed15cbe9da0035aa\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-substitution\">72-df-logic-program-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §2.5, print648/PDF660"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source definitions and composition direction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"不同元数谓词比较时避免越界项投影"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq T^2\">\\(E\\subseteq T^2\\)</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\sigma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta,\\sigma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>；代入扩张与顺序复合取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed15cbe9da0035aa\" href=\"?note=ed15cbe9da0035aa\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-substitution\">72-df-logic-program-substitution</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=R(\\vec t),B=S(\\vec u)\">\\(A=R(\\vec t),B=S(\\vec u)\\)</span> 为正关系原子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=a_R(R)\">\\(n=a_R(R)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Unif}(E,\\theta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\land\\forall\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in E\\ (t\\theta=u\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MGU}(E,\\theta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Unif}(E,\\theta)\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ (\\operatorname{Unif}(E,\\sigma)\\Rightarrow\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ (\\sigma=\\theta\\star\\delta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MGUAt}(R(\\vec t),S(\\vec u),\\theta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow R=S\\land\n\\operatorname{MGU}(\\{\\langle t_i,u_i\\rangle:i&lt;\\min(|\\vec t|,|\\vec u|)\\},\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Idem}(\\theta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\theta\\star\\theta=\\theta.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Unif}(E,\\theta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\land\\forall\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in E\\ (t\\theta=u\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MGU}(E,\\theta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Unif}(E,\\theta)\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ (\\operatorname{Unif}(E,\\sigma)\\Rightarrow\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ (\\sigma=\\theta\\star\\delta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MGUAt}(R(\\vec t),S(\\vec u),\\theta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow R=S\\land\n\\operatorname{MGU}(\\{\\langle t_i,u_i\\rangle:i&lt;\\min(|\\vec t|,|\\vec u|)\\},\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Idem}(\\theta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\theta\\star\\theta=\\theta.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最一般性要求每个统一子在全部变量上经复合因子化，而不只是某个原子的真值相同；原子统一要求谓词相同。空方程组由恒等代入统一并具有最一般性。式中等号始终是有限项树的字面相等，不是某个结构中的等式。</p>\n<p>本轮深审：MGUAt 的方程集合按两实参长度的最小值构造，避免 R 与 S 元数不同时先访问不存在的 u_i。外层 R=S 仍是必要条件；该条件成立时两个长度同为其元数，因而合法调用的数学含义完全保持。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-logic-program-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ed15cbe9da0035aa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-logic-program-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ed15cbe9da0035aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\subseteq T^2$ 有限，$\\theta,\\sigma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma$；代入扩张与顺序复合取 [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]。$A=R(\\vec t),B=S(\\vec u)$ 为正关系原子，$n=a_R(R)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta,\\sigma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A=R(\\vec t),B=S(\\vec u)","display":false},{"tex":"n=a_R(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Unif}(E,\\theta)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\land\\forall\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in E\\ (t\\theta=u\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MGU}(E,\\theta)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Unif}(E,\\theta)\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ (\\operatorname{Unif}(E,\\sigma)\\Rightarrow\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ (\\sigma=\\theta\\star\\delta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MGUAt}(R(\\vec t),S(\\vec u),\\theta)&:\\Longleftrightarrow R=S\\land\n\\operatorname{MGU}(\\{\\langle t_i,u_i\\rangle:i<\\min(|\\vec t|,|\\vec u|)\\},\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Idem}(\\theta)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\theta\\star\\theta=\\theta.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2303,"backlinks":[{"id":"866d47bca0b3782c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-551","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"2d49b9fae2b96976","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\theta,\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma$ 与 $t\\sigma$ 取 [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]，$\\operatorname{Unif},\\operatorname{MGU}$ 取 [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]]；合成先施 $\\theta$ 后施 $\\tau$。$\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}$ 以变量编号递增的顺序作全称闭包。$\\operatorname{EqBase}_{\\Sigma}(M)$ 只用于该签名的四值结构。DCA 仅在 $C\\cup F$ 有限时定义；其中 $x$ 与各 $\\vec y_f$ 互异，$|\\vec y_f|=a_F(f)$。"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-546","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"4f8fbd6e08fa4850","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P$ 是有限确定程序，体仅含正关系原子；$G,H$ 是有限正原子序列。使用 [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] 和 [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-546","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"e